    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "内部结构框图"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                67,
                95,
                194,
                112
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/dff3e6eb5c4923db3fd0c5b01138e6156188361563148aeb0d65356fe8572860.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "图 3 BP5011 内部框图"
                    }
                ],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                289,
                115,
                719,
                354
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "功能描述"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                388,
                154,
                405
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5011 是一款调光接口转换芯片，能够将调光端口的 0-10V信号、电阻两端电压信号或者 PWM 信号转换为 PWM 信号。转换后的 PWM 信号可以直接用来控制 LED 驱动芯片，或者经过光耦隔离，实现隔离调光方案应用。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                414,
                485,
                489
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5011 的 PWM 频率固定为 1kHz，调光器驱动电流 100μA。可兼容无源 0-10V 调光器和电位器。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                498,
                480,
                533
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "启动和供电"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                67,
                541,
                161,
                557
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "系统上电后，当 VCC 电压达到芯片开启阈值时，芯片内部振荡电路开始工作。为了能够提供 0-10V 调光器正常工作所需的电流，VCC 电压需大于 11V 左右。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                565,
                484,
                621
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "一旦 VDD 电压掉到 UVLO 电压，芯片停止工作，PWM 脚电压会被拉低。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                632,
                484,
                669
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "DIM脚电压和PWM信号占空比关系"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                67,
                678,
                356,
                695
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "DIM 脚电压和 OUT 脚输出 PWM 信号占空比关系曲线如下："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                703,
                465,
                719
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "chart",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/ae83a00c0bf1c8e09709614f1981f3dd16141b1a55f9f81f7eca1bcbe8601300.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "chart_caption": [],
                "chart_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                542,
                414,
                892,
                575
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "PCB Layout 指南"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                583,
                675,
                601
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在设计 BP5011 应用 PCB时，需要遵循以下建议："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                612,
                850,
                627
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1) VCC 的旁路电容需要紧靠芯片 VCC 和 GND 引脚，避免系统噪声干扰。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                636,
                929,
                671
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2) VDD 电容应靠近芯片引脚，避免系统噪声干扰。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                680,
                867,
                695
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3) 一般情况下建议在 DIM 引脚旁边放置一颗旁路电容， 滤除噪声。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                703,
                931,
                739
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5"
                    }
                ]
            },
